{'symbol': 'ITW', 'date': '2019-10-03 19:30:00', 'title': 'ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS ENTERED INTO A $2.5 BLN, 5-YEAR CREDIT FACILITY', 'text': 'ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS INC -  ON SEPT 27, CO ENTERED INTO A $2.5 BILLION, FIVE-YEAR CREDIT FACILITY.ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS INC -  CREDIT FACILITY REPLACES COMPANY’S PREVIOUS CREDIT FACILITY THAT WAS SET TO TERMINATE ON MAY 9, 2021..ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS INC -  UNDER CREDIT FACILITY, COMPANY PAYS A FACILITY FEE THAT VARIES BETWEEN 0.045% AND 0.110%.ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS -  CREDIT FACILITY INCLUDES PROVISION UNDER WHICH COMPANY MAY REQUEST AN INCREASE OF TOTAL FACILITY UP TO $4.5 BILLION.'}